{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32537","headline":"古出塞 · 刘驾","name":"古出塞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡风不开花，四气多作雪。\n北人尚冻死，况我本南越。\n古来犬羊地，巡狩无遗辙。\n九土耕不尽，武皇犹征伐。\n中天有高阁，图画何时歇？\n坐恐塞上山，低於沙中骨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}